            "id": 131237,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atur parameter untuk fungsi <code>duplicate</code> dengan benar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"duplicate\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"input: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"): \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" input * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(duplicate(\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"string\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"50\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>input</code>, diikuti oleh <code>:</code>, dan terakhir <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 131246,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jenis nilai apa yang dapat dimuat variabel <code>value</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">String</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Boolean</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Apa pun</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih String.</p></body></html>"
          },
